SilphCo_Interior5_Text_Man::
	.string "I love working for SILPH.\n"
	.string "It is the most important company\l"
	.string "in the world.\p"
	.string "Even more than that DEVON CORP.\n"
	.string "recently created.$"

SilphCo_Interior5_Text_Scientist::
	.string "Aaaah...\n"
	.string "Refreshed and restored...$"

SilphCo_Interior5_Text_Gentleman::
	.string "Here, in the PLANNING ROOM, we\n"
	.string "always think about a lot of\l"
	.string "possible new devices.\p"
	.string "But sometimes, we get a lot of\n"
	.string "strange ideas…$"

SilphCo_Interior5_Text_Scientist2::
	.string "We are always thinking about adding\n"
	.string "more stuff to the POKéGEAR.$"

SilphCo_Interior5_Text_Scientist3::
	.string "I’m pretty sure there are more than\n"
	.string "the POKéMON we currently know.\p"
	.string "That’s why I’m telling them we should\n"
	.string "do something to allow the POKéDEX\l"
	.string "to be expanded easily.$"

SilphCo_Interior5_Text_Scientist4::
	.string "I don’t know why they rejected my\n"
	.string "idea.\p"
	.string "It was about trading and battling\n"
	.string "POKéMON via a wireless system.\p"
	.string "I even called it the ”SUPER AWESOME\n"
	.string "WIRELESS SYSTEM”\l"
	.string "Ain’t that a great name?$"

SilphCo_Interior5_Text_Policeman::
	.string "This time I’m gonna keep guard\n"
	.string "till I drop!$"
